.git
.gitignore
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.DS_Store
*.log
.vercel
.archive
# ANCHORED with a leading slash. An unanchored `data` matches ANY directory named
# `data` at any depth, including `packages/ux-workflow/src/data/`, which is
# TypeScript source. Same reason for the others below.
/archive
/data
/docs
/packages/reactor-video
/--full-page
/impeccable-context

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SECRETS — must never enter an image.
#
# The Dockerfile copies `packages/` wholesale (the pnpm workspace needs every
# manifest), and this repo has REAL credentials committed in `packages/*/.env`
# files. Without these rules they would be baked into an image pushed to
# Artifact Registry.
#
# Verified after every build with:
#   docker run --rm <image> find / -name '.env*'   # must print nothing
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.env.local
**/.env.production.local
**/.env.preview.local
.custody
**/custody-audit.jsonl
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
